  "releaseNotes": "Patch release: Try methods (TryGet, TryAddReplace, TryGetOrAdd, TryRemove) now consistently return false instead of throwing for every failure except disposal. 5.1.1: the expiration task no longer stops after a persistence or Expired handler failure; synchronous GetOrAdd and AddOrUpdate no longer run factories, persistence, or event handlers under the cache lock; ExpirationIntervalMs changes take effect immediately.",
